# miniAPP candidate baselines are build artifacts produced by
# `pnpm --filter @miniapp/backend macros:baseline`. They're
# deterministic from the input cases, so committing them just
# pollutes PR diffs every time someone re-runs the runner.
#
# The ST ground-truth baseline (`sillytavern-original-macros-*.json`)
# IS committed — it's the immutable truth Step 0 diffs against.
miniapp-macros-*.json
